# UI style guidelines

Source of truth for tokens: `src/renderer/src/assets/index.css` `:root`.

## Tokens (use these — do not invent parallel palettes)

- **Ink:** `--clr-ink` (primary text), `--clr-ink-soft` (secondary/meta)
- **Surfaces:** `--clr-surface` (cards/panels), `--clr-cream` / `--clr-cream-deep` (page wash)
- **Accent:** `--clr-coral` / `--clr-coral-deep` (primary actions, “in progress”)
- **Secondary accent:** `--clr-teal` / `--clr-teal-soft` (success/done, project marks)
- **Chips only:** `--clr-chip-programs-*` (programs / in-progress labels), `--clr-chip-status-*` (done/status labels)
- **Radii:** `--radius-sm` controls, `--radius-md` content cards, `--radius-lg` columns/large cards, `--radius-pill` filters/search/segmented only
- **Shadows:** `--shadow-card` default, `--shadow-lift` hover
- **Fonts:** `--font-display` (Nunito) titles, `--font-body` (Outfit) UI copy

## Content cards (course cards, kanban project cards, stat cards)

- White `--clr-surface` background, `--border-thick`, `--radius-md` or `--radius-lg`, `--shadow-card`
- Title in ink + display font; meta/notes in `--clr-ink-soft`
- Hover: slight lift (`translateY(-1px/-2px)` + `--shadow-lift`), coral focus ring when focused
- **Do not** paint the whole card with chip colors or use `--radius-pill` on multi-line content cards
- Status on a card: left accent border or a small chip/badge — never a full pink/teal card wash
- If status is already shown by column/context (e.g. kanban), omit redundant status text on the card

## Chips & filters

- Pill radius is for compact controls (search, segmented, filter pills, status badges)
- Chip background colors are for labels/filters only, not card containers

## Panels & forms (project panel, drawers)

- Page/panel wash: cream + subtle coral/teal radial washes (match library hub)
- Header: muted surface + thin border (like app header / kanban header)
- Inputs: surface fill, thick border, `--radius-sm`; coral focus ring
- Field labels: small, soft ink; values: ink

## Buttons

- Prefer existing `.btn`, `.btn--primary`, `.btn--ghost`
- Compact actions inside cards: smaller padding + `--radius-sm`, no heavy shadow

## Motion

- Prefer `--ease-pop` for card hover/press; keep transitions short (~120–150ms)
- Do not add glow effects, multi-layer decorative shadows, or emoji as UI chrome
